LAST-MODIFIED:20260812T163314Z
UID:10006529-1792695600-1792702800@historicmanassas.org
SUMMARY:Factory of Fear - Outbreak
DESCRIPTION:A deadly outbreak has consumed the once-thriving ARTfactory\, transforming its four floors into a nightmare of infection\, chaos\, and survival. As emergency systems fail and the virus spreads unchecked\, visitors must navigate dark corridors\, abandoned laboratories\, and quarantined work spaces overrun by grotesque mutations and desperate survivors. Every level reveals a new stage of the catastrophe\, drawing guests deeper into the heart of the outbreak. The only question is whether you’ll escape the Factory of Fear—or become part of it.\n\nPatrons can receive $3 off admission on Thursday\, October 15 and 22. Enter code THURSDAYSCARIES at checkout. All proceeds benefit ARTfactory.
URL:https://historicmanassas.org/event/factory-of-fear-outbreak/2026-10-22/
LOCATION:ARTfactory (9419 Battle St.\, Manassas\, VA 20110)\, 9419 Battle Street\, Manassas\, VA\, 20110\, United States
CATEGORIES:Halloween
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://historicmanassas.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Factory-2026-TICKET-GRAPHIC.png
ORGANIZER;CN="ARTfactory":MAILTO:jexum@VirginiaARTfactory.org
END:VEVENT
