SUMMARY:ARTfactory 5K and Fun Run: A Frozen Experience
DESCRIPTION:The ARTfactory 5K: A Frozen Experience is a fun-filled winter-themed race that brings the community together in support of ARTfactory's mission to inspire creativity\, arts education\, and cultural engagement throughout the region. Participants of all ages are invited to run\, walk\, or jog through a festive course featuring icy surprises\, frosty-themed decorations\, and plenty of family-friendly entertainment. We invite you to dress up as your favorite characters and participate in our costume contest!\nWhat makes this event unique is its combination of fitness\, community spirit\, and the arts\, creating a one-of-a-kind experience that celebrates both healthy living and creative expression. Whether you're chasing a personal best or enjoying the fun atmosphere\, the ARTfactory 5K offers an unforgettable frozen adventure for a great cause.\nFee: 5K $40\, Fun Run $15 now through September 30th. Fee increases starting October 1st. Registration open until morning of the race.\nTo register\, visit our website at www.virginiaartfactory.org/5k
URL:https://historicmanassas.org/event/artfactory-5k-and-fun-run-a-frozen-experience/
LOCATION:Evergreen Community Club\, 15900 Berkeley Dr\, Haymarket\, VA\, 20169\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://historicmanassas.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/5K-FLYER.png
ORGANIZER;CN="ARTfactory":MAILTO:jexum@VirginiaARTfactory.org
END:VEVENT
